## 1. Definitions

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| **Software** | The NoHoldr project and all associated documentation files |
| **NoHoldr** | The original software project by Deviantkay, built on the principle: *"No holding files. No hidden processing. No retention."* |
| **Core Components** | Foundational architectural elements enabling NoHoldr's privacy-focused, retention-free operation (client-side processing, serverless execution) |
| **Functional Modules** | Distinct units of functionality: PDF Processing Engine, Image Processing Tools, Document Conversion Services, Media Processing Utilities, File Analysis Components |
| **Original Module** | Any Functional Module from the official repository, unmodified |
| **Modified Module** | Any Functional Module derived from an Original Module with alterations |
| **New Module** | Any Functional Module created independently, not present in the original repository |
| **Derivative Work** | Any work based on the Software (forks, modifications, adaptations, translations) |

