## 3. Attribution Requirements

### 3.1 General Attribution

The copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.

### 3.2 Derivative Work Attribution

Any Derivative Work must include clear attribution in at least one of:

- README or primary documentation
- Credits, Acknowledgments, or About section  
- LICENSE or NOTICE file
- Visible UI element (for graphical applications)

### 3.3 Attribution Format

| Module Type | Required Attribution Format |
|-------------|----------------------------|
| **Original** | `[Module Name] — Original component from NoHoldr by Deviantkay` |
| **Modified** | `[Module Name] — Based on [Original Name] from NoHoldr by Deviantkay, modified by [Author]` |
| **New** *(recommended)* | `[Module Name] — New component by [Author]` |

**Examples:**
```
PDF Processing Engine — Original component from NoHoldr by Deviantkay
Advanced PDF Tools — Based on PDF Processing Engine from NoHoldr by Deviantkay, modified by Example Corp
Document Converter — New component by Example Corp
```

